Nájila</p><p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold font-label font-medium">Fundadora da Royal English</p><p class="mt-5 lg:mt-[1.6vh] max-w-xl text-base lg:text-[clamp(0.74rem,1.75vh,0.95rem)] leading-relaxed text-on-navy-muted">Tradutora e intérprete de inglês e português, certificada em Cambridge Advanced (C1), Nájila ensina inglês há mais de 10 anos e já acompanhou mais de 300 alunos. Ela criou o Método Treino Cognitivo e Memorização para que o aluno pratique, repita e use o inglês no dia a dia.</p><ul class="mt-7 space-y-3 lg:mt-[2vh] lg:space-y-[1.2vh]"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm lg:text-[clamp(0.7rem,1.55vh,0.82rem)] text-on-navy-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Mais de 10 anos ensinando inglês</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm lg:text-[clamp(0.7rem,1.55vh,0.82rem)] text-on-navy-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Mais de 300 alunos acompanhados</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm lg:text-[clamp(0.7rem,1.55vh,0.82rem)] text-on-navy-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Formada em Tradução e Interpretação Inglês/Português</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm lg:text-[clamp(0.7rem,1.55vh,0.82rem)] text-on-navy-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Certificada Cambridge Advanced (C1)</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm lg:text-[clamp(0.7rem,1.55vh,0.82rem)] text-on-navy-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Especialista em conversação</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm lg:text-[clamp(0.7rem,1.55vh,0.82rem)] text-on-navy-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Criadora do Método Treino Cognitivo e Memorização</li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm lg:text-[clamp(0.7rem,1.55vh,0.82rem)] text-on-navy-muted"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check mt-0.5 size-4 shrink-0 text-gold" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>Estuda neuroplasticidade, bilinguismo e neurociência aplicada à educação</li></ul><blockquote class="mt-9 lg:mt-[2.4vh] border-l-2 border-gold/60 pl-6 font-serif text-xl lg:text-[clamp(0.9rem,2.2vh,1.15rem)] font-medium italic leading-relaxed text-on-navy">“Meu objetivo nunca foi criar mais um lugar para você assistir aulas de inglês. Eu queria criar uma forma de fazer você ter contato, praticar, repetir e realmente usar aquilo que aprende.”<footer class="mt-4 lg:mt-[1.2vh] text-xs uppercase not-italic tracking-[0.24em] text-gold font-label font-medium">Teacher Nájila</footer></blockquote></div></div></section>
